decision tree can be used for both classificcation and regression problem statement

ID3 and CART are algorithms for building Decision Trees.

ID3 → uses Entropy / Information Gain to choose splits.
CART → usually uses Gini Impurity for classification and can also do regression.

In short:

ID3 → Entropy
CART → Gini (classification) / MSE (regression)

a) entropy and gini index are two techniques used for purity split. purity split= number of yes/number of no.  if number of yes greater purity split is pure.

b) information gain. used to select the feature for DT construction.